Temby is a simple Emby client that can meet common video and music playback needs.

【Multi-server】
- Support adding multiple servers;
- Quickly switch between added servers.

【video】
- Supports playing common video formats;
- Support playing different video sources for the same project;
- Supports loading of embedded and external subtitles;
- Supports real-time transcoding and playback of different qualities on the server side;
- Commonly used function gestures can be performed while playing videos.

【collect】
- You can collect favorite content to facilitate quick location next time.

【search】
- Keyword search for videos is available.

【music】
- Can play music in different formats;
- Supports background music playback and line control;
- Supports loop playback in different modes, etc.

【download】
- Videos can be downloaded to this machine;
- Supports continued downloading after pause;
- Supports setting the number of download tasks and automatically retrying after an error;
- Support notification reminder after download is completed.

【Safety】
Add a PIN to the server to protect private content.



Notice:
This application is a tool application and does not provide any content. Please ensure that an emby server is available before use.
